    "abstract": {
      "en": "Spatial dataset showing average annual precipitation level in Armenia. It has been obtained based on the analysis of direct observations of more than 180 monitoring points. Data of meteorological stations and observation points with short series of measurement had been reduced using cartographic method (for ultra-short series) and ordinary method of ratio.",
